        {
          "text": " Eki n'ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyaizire ahari Hosea mwene Beeri omu busingye bwa Uziya, Yosamu, Ahazi na Hezekia abagabe ba Yuda, n'omu busingye bwa Yeroboamu mwene Yoashi omugabe wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
