        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Eiziina rye omwete Yezereeli; ahabw'okuba hatsigaire omwanya mukye, nkafubira enju ya Yehu ahabw'eshagama ei yaasheesheire Yezereeli, kandi ndyamariraho kimwe obugabe bw'enju ya Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
