        {
          "text": " Ogwo mukazi yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaara omwishiki. MUKAMA yaagira Hosea ati: Eiziina rye omwete Lo-ruhama, amakuru ngu Okutagirirwa mbabazi; ahabw'okuba tindigaruka kugirira nju ya Israeli embabazi, kubasaasira na kakye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.6",
