          "text": " Kwonka omubaro gw'Abaisraeli guryaingana n'omusheenyi gw'aha nyanja ogutarikubaasa kurengwa n'obu kwakuba okubarwa; kandi omu mwanya ahu baagambiriirwe ngu, Timuri bantu bangye, niho barigambirirwa ngu, Muri abaana ba Ruhanga ohuriire. ",
